 **Overlap Rules:**
-- **'or'**: Logical OR. `volume = volume | mask`.
-- **'and'**: Arithmetic addition. `volume = volume + mask`.
-- **'xor'**: Arithmetic addition with clipping. `volume = volume + mask`; `volume[volume > 1] = 0` [S1, unofficial].
